msgid "DVB-I loads the channel list from the internet. To do so, LinDVB contacts the registry or service list server whose address you enter, the servers that host the channel logos and, when the programme guide is switched on, the broadcasters' programme guide servers. These servers see your IP address and the time of the request. If you enter a postcode, it is sent to the service list server."
